th what  she was doing you know in her business  she liked her company but she needed a  bigger challenge he was something new  she does know what it looks like and so  she's going on this journey and she's  documenting the whole process and what  it does is it brings people along with  her you want to be able to post the  things that also make you scared and  things you're not sure about because  that's part of the journey right people  want to look back and see how you got to  where you are now and not just you  summarizing and telling it but  witnessing you along the way and the  things that you're scared about and the  things that you're not sure about and  how you got to where you are that builds  that builds  chin and so these four years math you  can be building this thing up and have  this huge community of of YouTube  viewers or blog readers or newsletter  subscribers whatever it is that that not  only are ready to buy whatever he has  when is really the sell it but also give  him constant motivation you know the  best part of my day is seen the comments  that come in on the YouTube videos you  guys keep me excited and motivated every  day when you're leaving the comments and  you say how much I've helped you with  your business and your motivation I love  that stuff and so you guys should all be  doing this in your companies as well  and if you're thinking about launching  business like Matthew is start  documenting the process now and getting  feedback now and at the start you're  gonna feel like you're talking to  yourself that's okay  put it up on your Facebook some of your  friends will join in the conversation  you're doing this to do it I know that  other people be inspired by your journey  and eventually this will be something  that will help millions of people  believe for those you watching like the  video thumbs up below leave a comment  you know how important it is to me leave  a comment if you have a question leave  it below in the comments and